{
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no mistake about this intensity."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's a new incident happening here!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As much as I hate to admit it,",
                "that god's information is precise."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could you be",
                "the magician from Gensokyo?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you doing",
                "in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How do you know who I am?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am the one who knows all."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's practically nothing",
                "I don't know anymore."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "O-oh..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The \"monster consumed by information\"",
                "that Yuiman mentioned earlier..."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"Monster\" is a mean word, isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even if I am just a shellfish."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm?"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "When you're here, you can understand",
                "all the truths of this world."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That kind of truth is so powerful",
                "it can even awaken fossils."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You are still a pitiful obsolete human",
                "who has not yet awakened."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let me show you for real!",
                "The truth of this world! The <i$ultimate truth>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way, I can't believe",
                "the truth was defeated..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What truth?",
                "You're just believing a bunch of silliness."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Silliness?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That god told me..."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The truth is always hidden."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And that's exactly why there's no truth in",
                "information that everyone can access."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? No truth?",
                "In the information I have?"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I think so too."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Truth doesn't exist in the",
                "world we can see."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Also, I was told to rescue any",
                "youkai consumed by information."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Rescue? You mean me?"
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't know if I can save you, but..."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Get out of here, quick.",
                "If you stay, you'll go crazy again."
            ]
        }
    }
}